    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5785a6df31157409f7238a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在新干线上，她会含糊其辞也理所当然。\n因为我还不足以成为支撑她的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dfe54a1c73403719f04ba56f477f56c993d02de40de4cb329e1b1c21752d6a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e31890f28c902a4301e71d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成为她渴求光时能化作温暖日光\n她想要阴影时又能化作荫蔽的\n那种存在――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6cd23955aa63c3d5fb41d9ef02f01090655c7a9d19fa90edf95ecd9fd5d55f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950380530d683371c1d64ad9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至少……要成为能一眼发现\n她状态不佳的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3fc8b77620acd8cc3ebe8ff8a0628879a8fc795266f4bfb5508b491295df865",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
